Code.NativeIaC:
```bicep
// Enable blob soft delete on the storage account
resource blobService 'Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/blobServices@2023-04-01' = {
  name: '<example_resource_name>/default'
  properties: {
    deleteRetentionPolicy: {
      enabled: true // Critical: enables soft delete for blobs
      days: 7       // Required when enabled
    }
  }
}
```

Code.Terraform:
```hcl
# Enable blob soft delete on the storage account
resource "azurerm_storage_account" "<example_resource_name>" {
  name                     = "<example_resource_name>"
  resource_group_name      = "<example_resource_name>"
  location                 = "<example_resource_name>"
  account_tier             = "Standard"
  account_replication_type = "LRS"

  blob_properties {
    delete_retention_policy {
      days = 7  # Critical: presence of this block enables soft delete for blobs
    }
  }
}
```
